  Label: The Ending: Heal the Bloom
  Label: The Hearthkeeper: "We walked out to the green growth together, and it remembered it had been a river."
  Label: The Hearthkeeper: "I still dream of the town we left behind, lit and empty."
  Label: The Hearthkeeper: "I wonder if the ruins would have been kinder, had we left them to rest."
  Label: The Hearthkeeper: "A second chance for everyone. I wonder what it costs the ones who do not know."
  Label: The Hearthkeeper: "A world kept whole is a world that does not change. I think of that sometimes."
  Label: The Hearthkeeper: "Somewhere a world is healing without us. I hope it forgives the hands that broke it."
  Label: The Bloom: "...a river... I was a river once..."
